{"id":"sorensen","title":"Sorensen-style dissimilarity","family":"lock-step","definition":"reference","intro_en":"This registry entry normalizes the absolute-error total by the sum of both vectors' absolute magnitudes. On nonnegative data it agrees with Bray-Curtis; signed data distinguish their denominators. The animation states the formula explicitly because the Sorensen name is also used for set-based coefficients with a different input object.","intro_zh":"此登记条目用两侧绝对幅值的总和归一化绝对误差总量。非负输入时它与 Bray-Curtis 相同，带符号输入时两者分母不同。Sorensen 也用于集合系数，因此本动图直接声明所演示的数值向量公式。","steps_en":["Keep the two series on the same sample grid; no shift or warping is estimated.","Accumulate absolute gaps; the highlighted point supplies one coordinate contribution.","Accumulate the coordinate contributions in sample order.","Divide by total absolute mass of both vectors."],"steps_zh":["在同一采样网格上比较两条序列，不估计平移或时间规整。","计算各坐标的绝对残差。","按采样顺序累积局部贡献。","用绝对差总和除以两向量绝对幅值的总和。"],"formula":"sum_i abs(x_i-y_i) / sum_i (abs(x_i)+abs(y_i))","caveats_en":["This is the registry's numerical-vector convention, not the binary set Dice coefficient.","Sample alignment and amplitude units are part of the comparison protocol."],"caveats_zh":["这里使用登记表的数值向量约定，与二元集合 Dice 系数的输入对象不同。","采样对齐和幅值单位属于比较协议的一部分。"],"sources":[{"label":"Imported registry: explicit formula convention","url":"https://github.com/ZipengWu365/EchoTime/blob/main/src/echotime/data/ts_similarity_package_v2_registry.csv"}],"x":[1.0,1.5,2.4,3.7,4.5,3.8,2.6,2.1,2.8,3.8,4.1,3.3],"y":[1.3,1.8,2.0,3.2,5.2,4.4,2.9,1.6,2.6,3.1,4.4,3.9],"input_label":"Deterministic synthetic illustration; sample index is the time axis.","parameters":{"samples":12,"preprocessing":"none","domain":"strictly positive illustration","global_denominator":72.0},"result":{"label":"distance","value":0.07500000000000001,"detail":"Exact formula evaluation on the displayed aligned vectors."},"frames":[{"phase":0,"caption":"Aligned samples","panel":{"kind":"lines","title":"Aligned samples","a":[1.0,1